<title>USA: Midwest Cash Grain PM - Corn values firm.</title>
<headline>Midwest Cash Grain PM - Corn values firm.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lower CBOT corn futures and a continued lack of cash selling prompted Midwest grain dealers to increase corn basis bids, grain dealers said.</p>
<p>The high values prompted a slight increase in old-crop sales.</p>
<p>Soybean basis bids increased at a few river terminals as exporters were forced to compete with recent increases in processor bids, dealers said.  </p>
<p>Basis values are quoted against CBOT futures, cash $/bu.</p>
